    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HouseLet Property are delighted to present this spacious two-bedroom ground floor apartment, ideally located within the highly sought-after development of The Court, Oldtown Mill, Celbridge.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 74 sq.m., the property offers particularly generous accommodation and is presented in excellent condition throughout, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a well-located and easily maintained home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway with excellent storage and access to the main accommodation.\r\nUtility Room\r\nSeparate utility room with fitted storage. Washing machine and dryer included.\r\nLiving / Dining Area\r\nA particularly spacious dual-aspect open-plan living and dining area, with two patio doors on separate elevations providing direct access to the private courtyard-style terrace. The outdoor space provides an attractive extension of the living accommodation, ideal for outdoor seating and enjoying direct access from the apartment.\r\nKitchen\r\nFully fitted kitchen with a good range of storage and workspace together with integrated and freestanding appliances.\r\nBedroom 1\r\nGenerous double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 2\r\nSpacious second double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\nBathroom\r\nWell-appointed main bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The dual-aspect open-plan living and kitchen area benefits from two sets of patio doors, providing direct access to the apartment's terrace area. This provides valuable private outdoor space and creates an excellent connection between the main living area and terrace, particularly attractive for those who enjoy outdoor seating, entertaining or simply having usable external space immediately outside the apartment.\r\nThe spacious open-plan living and dining area forms the heart of the property, while the fully fitted kitchen provides ample storage and workspace. Both bedrooms are generous doubles with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nFurther benefits include a separate utility room, good storage throughout and the convenience of a ground floor position.\r\nThe Court is a mature, quiet and well-maintained development with ample parking available for residents and visitors.\r\n\r\nManagement Company:\r\nWindhall Management Company Ltd.\r\nManaging Agent:\r\nFalcondale Properties"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Oldtown Mill is a well-established and highly regarded residential development, conveniently positioned within walking distance of Celbridge Village and its wide range of shops, cafés, schools, sporting facilities and other local amenities.\r\nThe area is very well connected, with easy access to the M4 motorway and regular public transport links to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. Hazelhatch and Celbridge train station is also within easy reach.\r\nCelbridge offers an excellent range of recreational amenities, including Castletown House and extensive walking routes along the River Liffey."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing by appointment only."
      }
    ],
